  "notes": "{見|み}せる is an ichidan verb meaning \"to show\" or \"to display.\"\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- Pair: {見|み}える (intransitive, to be visible)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- XにYを{見|み}せる: to show Y to X\n- {写真|しゃしん}を{見|み}せる: to show photos\n- {見|み}せてください: please show me\n- お{見|み}せする: to show (humble)\n\nEXTENDED MEANINGS:\n- {力|ちから}を{見|み}せる: to demonstrate one's power\n- やって{見|み}せる: to show (by doing)\n- {意地|いじ}を{見|み}せる: to show one's pride/stubbornness\n\nRELATED EXPRESSIONS:\n- {見|み}せびらかす: to show off, to flaunt\n- {見|み}せかける: to pretend, to make it appear",
